==Battleground==
*2 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Tarsiriel]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lowkey]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**6 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Great Angel Chibinel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Tarsiriel]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
**1 [[M. Ost]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is pure filler. Your UL Legends should shred this stage. If you happen to have Idi's True Form, she does insanely well here, having Sage Slayer to resist Tarsiriel's perma-Slow and dealing insane damage to the Relic enemies here.

